Subject: [PATCH 1866/3799] soh: rename func_809CF72C -> EnBw_SetupRearUp

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: plays the eyestalk-raise animation with the aiming sfx and installs the rearing action.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c
index 5f0274f64..eedf5e15a 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Bw/z_en_bw.c
